==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 41.33 seconds<sup>1,240f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is very easy, although balanced around [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3 [[Treasure]]s. Meatshielding and [[Dragon Cat]] should be enough to win.

==Trivia==
*Minato Domain is named after the Japanese word 港 ''minato'' (port; harbor).

